Changes to vendored TinySAM and MobileSAM prompt encoders: ignored label -2
embeddings are zeroed while retaining the token. The accepted versions are
distributed verbatim. Research scripts are extracted to the symbols needed
for training and point/box evaluation; numerical kernels retain their original
definitions. Unused quality/scoring branches are removed. Data path resolution
and public entry points are made portable. Source fingerprints are documented
in docs/source_manifest.json.

Pretrained tensors retain the upstream/model terms. Public model repacking
removes private filesystem metadata and joins each backbone with its six
active modules, without changing tensor values or precision. SHA256 and tensor
fingerprints are included in models.json and each checkpoint.
